# Not needed for local development: `npm run dev` loads the repo-root .env
# (see ../../.env.example). Use .dev.vars only to override a value for this app.
# Deployed secrets are set with `wrangler secret put SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY`.
#
# wrangler.toml holds the PRODUCTION values (only the live origin). For local development, put these two lines in the
# repo-root .env (or here), so the local web app at localhost:5173 is allowed:
# APP_ENV=development
# ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173
